body: "## Outcome\n\nProperty tests keep every seed, sequence and assertion under Node and Bun, while each sequence costs less. The three complete release gates (npm on Node 22 and 26, Bun) run in separate CI jobs, and the documentation reports their measured hosted durations. Bringing the Node 22 npm job to 90 minutes or less continues in pm-memory-higm.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- No sampling, seed-count reduction, skipped runtime, or raised timeout.\n- Temp directories are removed even on failure.\n- Gates run serially after a disk check.\n- The item stays open for orchestrator verification."
